 about that mo brooks has some  stories to tell  and i hope that he gets the chance to  tell them now ordinarily i would not  be in favor of the committee giving in  to his demands right you've subpoenaed  him you don't have to give in to  anything  but  if it means getting dirt on trump that  we otherwise might not get because  brooks wants to challenge it in court or  whatever he may choose to do  i say give in  put him on tv put it back in prime time  and let everybody hear what little mo  brooks has to say  about donald trump the man who screwed  him over  in his quest to be a united states  senator  we have to take a quick break but you  can get more from me on my youtube  channels check me out at youtube.com  slash the ring of fire and youtube.com  fair and balanced i'm fair and cousins  in for david pakman and we'll be back  with more
 

